                        <p class="CellBodyC">--</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top; width: 31.2277pt">
                        <p class="CellBodyC">--</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="background-color: #B2B2B2;border: 1px solid black; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top; width: 468.7532000000001pt" colspan="12">
                        <p class="CellBody"><span class="bold">End Notes</span></p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top; width: 22.769pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">1. </p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top; width: 445.9842000000001pt" colspan="11">
                        <p class="CellBody">A definition of each listed use type is in Chapter <a href="../Flagstaff10/Flagstaff1080000.html#10.80">10-80</a>, Definitions.</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top; width: 22.769pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">2.</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top; width: 445.9842000000001pt" colspan="11">
                        <p class="CellBody">Charter schools proposed in existing single-family residences shall be located on residential lots one acre or greater. Charter schools shall be subject to the review processes established in A.R.S. &sect;<a href="//www.codepublishing.com/cgi-bin/ars.pl?cite=15-189.01" target="_parent">15-189.01</a>, as amended.</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top; width: 22.769pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">3.</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top; width: 445.9842000000001pt" colspan="11">
                        <p class="CellBody">Not permitted where public water, sewer, or streets are not available to serve the property.</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top; width: 22.769pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">4.</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top; width: 445.9842000000001pt" colspan="11">
                        <p class="CellBody">Use is allowed only on a lot or parcel with a net lot area of five acres or greater.</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top; width: 468.7532000000001pt" colspan="12">
                        <p class="CellBody" style="white-space:nowrap">Key</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top; width: 125.83630000000001pt" colspan="2">
                        <p class="CellBody">P</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top; width: 60.9481pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">=</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top; width: 125.83630000000001pt" colspan="9">
                        <p class="CellBody">Permitted Use</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top; width: 45pt" colspan="2">
                        <p class="CellBody" style="white-space:nowrap">UP</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top; width: 60.9481pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">=</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top; width: 362.80510000000004pt" colspan="9">
                        <p class="CellBody">Conditional Use &ndash; Requires the Approval of a Conditional Use Permit</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top; width: 125.83630000000001pt" colspan="2">
                        <p class="CellBody"> --</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top; width: 60.9481pt">
                        <p class="CellBody">=</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 4pt 2pt 2pt 3pt; vertical-align: top; width: 125.83630000000001pt" colspan="9">
                        <p class="CellBody">Use Not Allowed</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
</table>
            <p class="P1">C. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="bold">Residential Zones &ndash; Building Form Standards and Property Development Standards. </span>The building form and property development standards shown in Table 10-40.30.030.C. shall apply to all property within the corresponding residential zone.</p>

