        <tr>
          <td style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 2.5pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top" colspan="6">
                        <p class="CellBody">2. Sustainable features marked as &ldquo;Not Allowed&rdquo; may be approved by the Director and Stormwater Manager if it can be demonstrated that the proposed sustainable feature can be installed with the intent and character of the nontransect zone.</p>

